  "goal": "Question: Do the five proposed operations divide deterministic compute work from intelligence work at the right places, and which operation boundary is most likely to make Prime repeat manual work or lose a finding?\nWhy: If the split is wrong, the module either automates a judgement it should only record, or leaves Prime re-typing context and custody facts on every Colab. Both failures were seen before the design was recovered.",
